  "protocol": "Three seeds per condition, one run per seed; 32768 entity slots, 8192 random founders, normal sunlight/thermal physics, random and archived arrivals until 300 seconds, no arrivals afterward, end at 900 seconds. Scope changes founder sampling; local mutation retains the same founding programs as control. Neither comparison is a deterministic paired ecological counterfactual: GPU allocation/contention and later random draw streams can change trajectories. Timing excluded.",
